                    {
                        "form_id": "4f494b86-48d9-44cd-8077-6fe2d1c14b68",
                        "entry_id": "383a31ab-8daf-3dbc-93e6-77387943e65a",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "prepositional"
                        ],
                        "form": "ворча́ниях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "4875dbb5-4266-31e9-9424-0b2e41aa71a8",
                        "entry_id": "383a31ab-8daf-3dbc-93e6-77387943e65a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "действие по значению гл. ворчать; невнятное выражение неудовольствия бормотанием"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4cfc78c2-d1a5-4484-9f3f-18fc80ee7491",
                                "sense_id": "4875dbb5-4266-31e9-9424-0b2e41aa71a8",
                                "text": "Пугачёв сел на том диване, на котором, бывало, дремал Иван Кузмич, усыплённый ворчанием своей супруги."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4152979-a8c3-4978-b016-4e1e51ffec83",
                                "sense_id": "4875dbb5-4266-31e9-9424-0b2e41aa71a8",
                                "text": "Не слушая недовольное ворчание официантки, я схватила сумочку и ушла."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "06236fff-831d-36c2-89b7-02d6bf9a5425",
                        "entry_id": "383a31ab-8daf-3dbc-93e6-77387943e65a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "угрожающий протяжный низкий звук, издаваемый животным, либо напоминающий его"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "39e0dc55-fbd4-45df-8c1a-049893ed63f1",
                                "sense_id": "06236fff-831d-36c2-89b7-02d6bf9a5425",
                                "text": "Охрипший собачий лай, ворчание — медведь рядом, а ружье переломлено!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8dece450-0e53-43e2-8f13-0ba8f7100ebf",
                                "sense_id": "06236fff-831d-36c2-89b7-02d6bf9a5425",
                                "text": "Через четверть часа дверь закрылась, послышался гул и ворчание бегущей по трубам воды, затем откинулась выходная площадка, и пять закованных в металл фигур с ярко горящими фонарями на шлемах вышли в ночную подводную тьму."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c0a7b03f-9ace-4a8c-baa6-a5417506c365",
                        "source_entry_id": "383a31ab-8daf-3dbc-93e6-77387943e65a",
                        "source_sense_description": "недовольное бормотанье человека",
                        "target_lang_word": "buzzing",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "buzzing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "444e4456-edc6-3f0f-9e68-9f16e6a8d722",
                                        "entry_id": "5213da1b-46ef-367a-b95c-bb84db73c7f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "gerund of buzz"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c45c9ad0-72ca-48dd-a3a6-d9c8fd40eabe",
                                                "sense_id": "444e4456-edc6-3f0f-9e68-9f16e6a8d722",
                                                "text": "Surely it is an yl miſorder yͭ folk ſhalbe walking vp & down in the ſermon time (as I haue ſene in this place this Lent: & there ſhalbe ſuch huſſyng & buſſyng in the preachers eare, that it maketh hym oftentymes to forget his matter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "21243638-7d2a-3db1-a16d-fb1a8b6f4d24",
                                        "entry_id": "5213da1b-46ef-367a-b95c-bb84db73c7f2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The sound produced by something that buzzes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5ca2c02-88a0-4355-8a1f-7cc48e25f858",
                                                "sense_id": "21243638-7d2a-3db1-a16d-fb1a8b6f4d24",
                                                "text": "I can hear buzzing coming from the television."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "buzzing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7ed4ae2c-c787-3f7d-a186-e30508628176",
                                        "entry_id": "d7d19dab-46b9-3f51-a5bc-5a7aec4f37f5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "present participle and gerund of buzz"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "form-of",
                                            "gerund",
                                            "participle",
                                            "present"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "buzzing",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6cb02084-18e7-32fc-aaf2-441aa74366bb",
                                        "entry_id": "4b3f7a4d-2283-3e07-84b6-f89232ecad8a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very happy; full of joyful excitement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0730afec-8619-41e9-8a12-a4f01666c6f9",
                                                "sense_id": "6cb02084-18e7-32fc-aaf2-441aa74366bb",
                                                "text": "'She was buzzing, mate, I tell you. She was so funny to listen to. It's the happiest phone call I've had off her in a while.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0f0f1f7-e1a6-4ade-ad9d-07e3394c61dd",
                                                "sense_id": "6cb02084-18e7-32fc-aaf2-441aa74366bb",
                                                "text": "“Nice one? It's amazing! There's loads like that,” he tells me. “Everyone is raving about you.”\nI'm totally buzzing. It's a shame Mum and Granddad aren't here."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "867fe534-c621-4792-bfd2-7bfae489aa91",
                                                "sense_id": "6cb02084-18e7-32fc-aaf2-441aa74366bb",
                                                "text": "'We shall see,' he said. 'But it did go unusually well , I must say.'\nYou were absolutely buzzing when I met you at Paddington,' said Niall."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0dfe1f6-c0ad-43f6-aa47-3947c84b560e",
                                                "sense_id": "6cb02084-18e7-32fc-aaf2-441aa74366bb",
                                                "text": "\"I thought we were good first half apart from the goal. I was in the toilet at half-time, I felt sick all morning but fine now, I feel buzzing.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4c641ca7-f436-4c13-977b-d33feac15f47",
                                                "sense_id": "6cb02084-18e7-32fc-aaf2-441aa74366bb",
                                                "text": "\"But I wanted to phone Bobby. Honestly, I felt like Santa. He was absolutely over the moon. It's a strong 21s squad, so he's in good company. I think Davie was more buzzing for Bobby than he was for himself.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "80c3d2f0-ff06-4d4e-bab9-5883467b91b8",
                        "source_entry_id": "383a31ab-8daf-3dbc-93e6-77387943e65a",
                        "source_sense_description": "недовольное бормотанье человека",
                        "target_lang_word": "mutter",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "mutter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0518fce2-d62f-3050-b4c5-c5c4c2517e73",
                                        "entry_id": "8c644a5e-950c-3b2e-abc8-f7ccadfd5273",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peas."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mutter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "69e51a80-b56f-357a-97fa-eb213177281e",
                                        "entry_id": "aa1cbfe6-16cb-37d8-a4fb-3c307f15da08",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A repressed or obscure utterance; an instance of muttering."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc39a472-8f2d-4e58-8786-3d334fa8252b",
                                                "sense_id": "69e51a80-b56f-357a-97fa-eb213177281e",
                                                "text": "The prisoners were docile, and accepted their lot with barely a mutter."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "mutter",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                        "entry_id": "1935f2a3-41d5-3294-86d9-7fe4ca31217f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To utter words, especially complaints or angry expressions, indistinctly or with a low voice and lips partly closed; to say under one's breath."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70a5cab6-bc1e-4c55-9d71-08997777449d",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                                "text": "You could hear the students mutter as they were served sodden spaghetti, yet again, in the cafeteria."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f520b7e2-a3a8-46c0-872c-bebafee34c39",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                                "text": "The beggar muttered words of thanks, as passersby dropped coins in his cup."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29fa622d-17cd-4f24-b12a-620388e23a8e",
                                                "sense_id": "cdfdb8b2-468d-347d-88ee-83615c22419e",
                                                "text": "This set – the set of Rosol's life – was studded with aces and menacing ground-strokes that left Nadal an impotent spectator often muttering to himself and at the umpire regarding a perceived misdemeanour by his opponent."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "822053d4-d579-3faa-9ebc-c1c7ec7ce73e",
                                        "entry_id": "1935f2a3-41d5-3294-86d9-7fe4ca31217f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To speak softly and incoherently, or with imperfect articulations."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ebd9899-c21c-4995-8d2a-72d4b6f4261b",
                                                "sense_id": "822053d4-d579-3faa-9ebc-c1c7ec7ce73e",
                                                "text": "The asylum inmate muttered some doggerel about chains and pains to himself, over and over."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db8f30de-1ad7-4f82-8b68-8bbe48c3bb35",
                                                "sense_id": "822053d4-d579-3faa-9ebc-c1c7ec7ce73e",
                                                "text": "Meantime your filthy foreigner will stare, / And mutter to himself."
                                            }
                                        ]
